    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quassātūra</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		quasso, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a shaking;</i> hence, transf., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An injury occasioned by shaking</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quassaturas fovere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. Val. 4, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A part injured by shaking</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 1, 28, 5</span></i>.</div>
